messages:
Chen Wu: For polling/backoff: recommend exponential backoff with jitter. Guidance copy for docs: start = 300ms, factor = 2, max = 10s, jitter = full/random. Also: when server returns 202 or 429 include `Retry-After` header (seconds) to give a polite interval. Example pseudo: 

```js
async function pollStatus(id) {
  let delay = 300;
  while (true) {
    const res = await fetch(`/v1/jobs/${id}`);
    if (res.status === 200) { const body = await res.json(); if (["succeeded","failed","cancelled"].includes(body.status)) return body; }
    // on 202/slow responses, backoff + jitter
    await sleep(delay * (0.5 + Math.random()));
    delay = Math.min(10000, delay * 2);
  }
}
```
